[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive00/text",
    "raw": "Welcome to your Mech Training Course. You can exit and enter your Mech with ^#FF1493;[E]^reset;.",
    "value": "欢迎来到机甲训练课程。你可以通过按下^#FF1493;[E]^reset;键进出您的机甲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive01/text",
    "raw": "The ^#orange;Tricorder^reset; can help you ^orange;equip^reset; and ^orange;refuel^reset; your mech. Fuel is important, so keep your mech topped up. Press the corresponding buttons on the tricorder after this mission to check it out. ^#Red;(If you see 'unauthorized user' restart the mission.)",
    "value": "^#orange;三度仪^reset;能帮助你^orange;装备^reset;机甲并^orange;补充燃料^reset;。燃料至关重要，请确保机甲燃料充足。任务结束后，按下三度仪上的对应按钮即可查看状态。^#Red;（若显示“unauthorized user”，请重新开始任务。）"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive02/text",
    "raw": "Your mech can ^#FF1493;duck by pressing ^#FF1493;[DOWN]^reset;, or ^#FF1493;sprint with a ^#FF1493;[double-tap]^reset; in the direction you are walking.",
    "value": "你的机甲可以通过按下^#FF1493;[下]^reset;键^#FF1493;进行下蹲^reset;，或向行走方向^#FF1493;[双击方向键]^reset;以进行^#FF1493;冲刺^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive03/text",
    "raw": "Your mech will auto-crouch to fit into areas that it can pass, should the need arise. Such as at the top of this passage.",
    "value": "当需要时，你的机甲会自动蹲伏以通过可通行的区域，例如这段通道的顶部。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/testdrive04/text",
    "raw": "Remember, you can create a ^orange;Mech Repair tool^reset; at your ^orange;Tinkering Table^reset; and upgrade it to be more effective using your ^orange;Tricorder's upgrade menu^reset;.",
    "value": "请记住，你可以在你的^orange;改造台^reset;处制作^orange;机甲修理工具^reset;，并通过^orange;三度仪的升级菜单^reset;来提升其效能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive03b/text",
    "raw": "Your mech switches to a ground-movement configuration when in an environment with gravity, you can manually switch from ground-movement to flight-mode by ^#FF1493;double tapping the [UP] key^reset;, even on planets. Do so now to continue.",
    "value": "当处于有重力的环境中时，你的机甲会自动切换至地面移动模式。即使是在行星上，你也可以通过^#FF1493;双击[上]键^reset;手动从地面移动模式切换至飞行模式。现在请执行此操作以继续。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive03c/text",
    "raw": "Please be aware of your mech's ^#bf2fe2;fuel^white; and ^#1d8e25;health^white; reserves, visualised respectively as the ^green;colored bars you can see above your vehicle^reset;. The ^#bf2fe2;fuel^white; will deplete over time and the ^#1d8e25;health^white; bar will deplete when the mech takes damage.",
    "value": "请注意观察你机甲的^#bf2fe2;燃料^white;和^#1d8e25;生命值^white;储备，它们分别以^green;彩色条的形式显示在载具上方^reset;。^#bf2fe2;燃料^white;会随时间逐渐消耗，而^#1d8e25;生命值^white;会在机甲受到伤害时减少。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/futestdrive04/text",
    "raw": "Zero gravity combat is a bit trickier than on flat ground. Accuracy is important, so you'll need to learn to lead your targets properly.",
    "value": "在零重力环境下作战比在平地上要复杂一些。精准度至关重要，因此你需要学会如何正确预判目标的移动轨迹。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/testdrive05/text",
    "raw": "Hostile entities also exist in zero-gravity environments. My cosmonautical records indicate that defeating them may result in obtaining an erchius battery, which your mech can absorb to replenish health and fuel.",
    "value": "在零重力环境中同样存在敌对实体。根据我的航天记录，击败它们有可能获得厄尔吉斯电池，你的机甲可以吸收这种电池来恢复生命值和燃料。"
  },
  {
