    "path": "/futestdrive05/text",
    "raw": "Now try throwing your mass around. Try to ^#FF1493;leap and ^#FF1493;stomp^reset; on the creatures ahead.",
    "value": "现在试着用你的质量去冲撞。尝试^#FF1493;跳跃并^#FF1493;踩踏^reset;前方的生物。"
  },
